                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c385bd1a-68d3-3bb8-985f-661b70cfafe6",
                        "entry_id": "5695db67-660e-3354-8cd9-cfe133d5d90e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "то, что унижает, умаляет, оскорбляет достоинство кого-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f9e3c5f-65aa-49b8-9960-4727cbd0f150",
                                "sense_id": "c385bd1a-68d3-3bb8-985f-661b70cfafe6",
                                "text": "И именно от этого почувствовал такую обиду, такое унижение ― меня же всего, значит, общупывали, перекатывали, только денег не нашли, придурки."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "38dbb0fb-5926-4c13-951e-601ce8cdbfd3",
                        "source_entry_id": "5695db67-660e-3354-8cd9-cfe133d5d90e",
                        "source_sense_id": "c385bd1a-68d3-3bb8-985f-661b70cfafe6",
                        "source_sense_description": "действие",
                        "target_lang_word": "humiliation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humiliation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d364b87-5654-3620-8f24-6d41ce22117f",
                                        "entry_id": "4bee1a95-e550-3f61-a346-7053e05d2fc2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of humiliating or humbling someone; abasement of pride; mortification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f25333fa-bdfe-459d-8c12-c76bce9303c8",
                                                "sense_id": "5d364b87-5654-3620-8f24-6d41ce22117f",
                                                "text": "Seeing the British establishment struggle with the financial sector is like watching an alcoholic […]. Until 2008 there was denial over what finance had become. When a series of bank failures made this impossible, there was widespread anger, leading to the public humiliation of symbolic figures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d66dccfe-360a-3136-86ab-af1d84ab04c3",
                                        "entry_id": "4bee1a95-e550-3f61-a346-7053e05d2fc2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being humiliated, humbled or reduced to lowliness or submission."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bbde3a3-ddbf-476c-89d5-dff4ede31bf1",
                                                "sense_id": "d66dccfe-360a-3136-86ab-af1d84ab04c3",
                                                "text": "Loving and beloved by him, how different would her destiny have been! An utter sense of desolation came over her; a terror of the future, an overwhelming agony in the present. That he, of all others, should be the one to witness her humiliation!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2cfe650-daa9-41b3-b861-b9e754834e65",
                                                "sense_id": "d66dccfe-360a-3136-86ab-af1d84ab04c3",
                                                "text": "One morning Mr. and Mrs. Lincoln were having breakfast when Lincoln did something that aroused the fiery temper of his wife. What, no one remembers now. But Mrs. Lincoln, in a rage, dashed a cup of hot coffee into her husband's face. And she did it in front of the other boarders.\n Saying nothing, Lincoln sat there in humiliation and silence while Mrs. Early came with a wet towel and wiped off his face and clothes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "200a188d-924a-4f56-a1e2-84174da7b9e7",
                                                "sense_id": "d66dccfe-360a-3136-86ab-af1d84ab04c3",
                                                "text": "They listened to the sound of Fanny’s retreating footsteps. ‘Well, well!’ said Marcus. ‘Oh, take no notice Jess. You know what our Frances Maud is like! It’s nothing to cry about!’ To her humiliation Jessamy found there were tears trickling down her cheeks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07b63c3b-a28d-43fd-80d1-1d262c58c6e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "5695db67-660e-3354-8cd9-cfe133d5d90e",
                        "source_sense_id": "c385bd1a-68d3-3bb8-985f-661b70cfafe6",
                        "source_sense_description": "действие",
                        "target_lang_word": "abasement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "abasement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2df83ff2-813a-3543-945a-8ea4f1cf4db8",
                                        "entry_id": "8f9c9498-f3cf-3291-a1bf-bd36e5e05c05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of abasing, humbling, or bringing low."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1a6e0dc-2037-3ac6-a00f-42431fd35d23",
                                        "entry_id": "8f9c9498-f3cf-3291-a1bf-bd36e5e05c05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being abased or humbled; humiliation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "623c1462-da99-4056-a6f4-d0d9829a2273",
                                                "sense_id": "c1a6e0dc-2037-3ac6-a00f-42431fd35d23",
                                                "text": "He was wearing cavalry twill trousers and a buff crew-neck sweater. The effect was of symbolic abasement mixed with military resolve […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e75fdd96-33fb-444a-8cef-9d96ea91657f",
                        "source_entry_id": "5695db67-660e-3354-8cd9-cfe133d5d90e",
                        "source_sense_id": "c385bd1a-68d3-3bb8-985f-661b70cfafe6",
                        "source_sense_description": "действие",
                        "target_lang_word": "humillación",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humillación",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a9bda21-1d05-3b66-90fd-6e240d6ad3af",
                                        "entry_id": "3afcc5fd-da72-35c2-a26b-0e2cb3086aee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acción o efecto de humillar o de humillarse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "062a51eb-e95c-456d-8a7a-e0c9ca39beef",
                                                "sense_id": "7a9bda21-1d05-3b66-90fd-6e240d6ad3af",
                                                "text": "de leer dijo el duque de Berganza bien están y luego el duque de Medina quitó su gorra y hizo una grande humillación a la princesa y dijo al duque de Berganza es ésta la muy alta y serenísima princesa, doña María, hija del muy alto y esclarecido Rey Don Juan y de la muy alta y esclarecida Reina Doña Catalina, su mujer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aeb48ff-d1c1-4133-893f-1a332c26f847",
                                                "sense_id": "7a9bda21-1d05-3b66-90fd-6e240d6ad3af",
                                                "text": "Mas después que entendió los fines que llevaba el papa, y que habiéndose enviado por el rey su sobrino Arnaldo Sanz como persona acepta al papa con gran humillación y sumisión y con muchos ofrecimientos, en conclusión había vuelto con respuesta que por ninguna cosa no consentiría que se nombrase o intitulase rey del reino."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ac00ac6-4204-372b-ac7d-fa3907126522",
                                        "entry_id": "3afcc5fd-da72-35c2-a26b-0e2cb3086aee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hecho o dicho que humilla."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9675a088-5467-46b6-a672-c4bcf7eef6c2",
                                                "sense_id": "7ac00ac6-4204-372b-ac7d-fa3907126522",
                                                "text": "Tres humillaciones ha sufrido el egoísmo humano: Copérnico destruye la ilusión de la tierra como centro del universo; en su biología, Darwin establece que el hombre, rey del mundo animal, no es más que un animal evolucionado; y Freud, en su psicoanálisis, que la vida afectiva del hombre no está del todo sometida a su voluntad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a09053bf-17a5-4a83-ab89-1a2ee1d52c33",
                                                "sense_id": "7ac00ac6-4204-372b-ac7d-fa3907126522",
                                                "text": "Expresiones como 'indios caitudos', 'kawachines', 'indios de la montaña' para los estudiantes de bilingüe son interpretados como insultos y humillaciones verbales."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
